    "extract": "Champasak HAGL Avenir Football Club is a professional football club based in Pakse, Champasak Province, Laos. The club was established in 2015 and competes in the Lao League 1, the top tier of Laotian football. The club plays its home matches at Champasak Stadium which holds 12,000 people.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Champasak HAGL Avenir Football Club</b> is a professional football club based in Pakse, Champasak Province, Laos. The club was established in 2015 and competes in the Lao League 1, the top tier of Laotian football. The club plays its home matches at Champasak Stadium which holds 12,000 people.</p>"
